CheMeleon pretrained checkpoint
-------------------------------
The post hoc frozen-encoder arm downloads the CheMeleon D-MPNN weights from
Zenodo by URL and verifies them against a pinned SHA-256 digest. The
checkpoint file is not redistributed in this repository; it is stored locally
at ~/.chemprop/chemeleon_mp.pt when that arm is run.

Source: https://zenodo.org/records/15460715
